+// NOM-4 explore-pagination T11 (spec F4, F10): accumulated and in-flight
+// search pages never survive a viewer or access change on mobile. Login,
+// verification, logout, account switch, block/unblock and focus revalidation
+// must cancel affected /search requests and discard their pages before the new
+// access state is displayed, and a late response from the old state can never
+// restore hidden or selectable rows.
+//
+// Contract pinned for P20: `resetSearchAccess(queryClient)` from
+// lib/search-access.ts returns a promise; it cancels in-flight search-backed
+// queries (Explore, profile by-author, picker), removes their pages and lets
+// mounted lists restart at page one.
